---
title: AdviseCare - Activity Diagram - WF2 Student Requests Support
---

flowchart TD
    S((Start)) --> A1[Student signs in and opens Request support]
    A1 --> A2[Choose support type and category, and the subject for an academic request]
    A2 --> A3[Write the reason]
    A3 --> A4[System offers the active attributes of the category's consent purpose]
    A4 --> D1{Share any data?}
    D1 -->|Yes| A5[Choose attributes, each becomes a consent for that purpose]
    D1 -->|No| A6
    A5 --> A6[Submit: case created, stage pending, priority medium, Programme Heads notified]
    A6 --> B1[Programme Head opens the matching queue]
    B1 --> B2[System suggests advisors: familiar pair, subject specialist, same faculty, lightest workload]
    B2 --> B3[Programme Head assigns an advisor: stage assigned]
    B3 --> B4[Student gets the advisor's contact information, advisor gets a notification]
    B4 --> C1[Advisor opens the case and the student's directory data and consented data, every value shown is logged]
    C1 --> D2{More data needed?}
    D2 -->|Yes| C2[Send a consent request, see EX7]
    D2 -->|No| C3
    C2 --> C3[Advisor and student meet outside the app, stage contacted]
    C3 --> C4[Advisor records notes and finalizes them]
    C4 --> D3{Needs someone else?}
    D3 -->|Another advisor| C5[Refer the case, see EX4]
    D3 -->|Money matter| C6[Refer to the Welfare Officer, see WF2b]
    D3 -->|No| C7
    C5 --> C7
    C6 --> C7[Advisor follows up, stage followUp]
    C7 --> C8[Advisor closes the case: status closed, student notified]
    C8 --> X((End))
